  "issueTitle": "What kind of journal is this",
  "issueParagraphOne": "{{site}} is a personal journal published as field notes. It records the trade-offs made in engineering practice, the details noticed in design, and the fragments of reading and daily life worth keeping. Posts are arranged as issues and can be browsed from the post index or the archive timeline.",
